<title>USA: ITT Industries Q3 oper shr rises.</title>
<headline>ITT Industries Q3 oper shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>WHITE PLAINS, N.Y. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.36		    $0.27</p>
<p> Oper net		  43,700		   31,600</p>
<p> Sales		  2,044,800		2,047,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 120,400		  117,700</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper shr		     n/a			n/a</p>
<p> Oper net		 151,400		  151,600</p>
<p> Sales		  6,490,000		6,630,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers) Full company name is ITT Industries Inc</p>
<p>NOTE: Including a $114.7 million after-tax charge in 1995 associated with the disposition of non-strategic assets, the company lost $0.46 per share in the third quarter 1995. Net income for the nine months ending Aug 31 1995 excludes this charge, the company said.</p>
<p>First Call mean earnings estimate for third quarter 1996 was $0.36 per share.</p>
<p>9 mths per share not given.</p>
